From a4f485e31ce53c45091670e6453e2983e6838f07 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kostersitz <mkostersitz@mac.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 00:06:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Use the bp3a/bp4a Launcher3 flag values in the bp2a release
 config (r4 port)

android-16.0.0_r4 Launcher3 is written for the BP4A release flags. With bp2a,
flags such as all_apps_blur and enable_overview_background_wallpaper_blur are
off and the code falls into broken paths (ScalingWorkspaceRevealAnim passes an
integer resource to getDimensionPixelSize and crashes Launcher3 on swipe-up).
Copy the bp3a/bp4a values for every Launcher3 flag the source declares, except
the ones ponces already sets.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
